{{ define "photos_probe" }}<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="h-100" data-bs-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>Photos probe</title>
  <link href="./assets/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="bg-dark text-light">
<div class="container py-3" style="max-width: 640px">
  <h4>Photos probe</h4>
  <ol class="small">
    <li>Start with Photos, N = 20. Raise N (30, 50, 80) until the sheet fails, or "Save N Images" saves fewer than N. Check the Photos app's count each time.</li>
    <li>Then raise the MB cap with large photos until Safari reloads the page or the share fails.</li>
    <li>Then try videos, from small to large, until one fails or the tab reloads.</li>
    <li>Copy the log and send it.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="small text-secondary">Files listed here are your own photos and videos, largest first. A tab reload is a result too: the log survives it.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-3">Photos</h5>
  <p id="probe-photo-summary" class="small text-secondary"></p>
  <div class="row g-2 align-items-end">
    <div class="col-4"><label class="form-label small" for="probe-n">Files (N)</label>
      <input id="probe-n" type="number" min="1" value="20" class="form-control"></div>
    <div class="col-4"><label class="form-label small" for="probe-cap">Cap (MB)</label>
      <input id="probe-cap" type="number" min="1" value="1500" class="form-control"></div>
    <div class="col-4"><button id="probe-photos-try" type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-100">Try</button></div>
  </div>

  <h5 class="mt-4">One video</h5>
  <div class="row g-2 align-items-end">
    <div class="col-8"><select id="probe-video" class="form-select"></select></div>
    <div class="col-4"><button id="probe-video-try" type="button" class="btn btn-primary w-100">Try</button></div>
  </div>

  <p id="probe-status" class="mt-3"></p>
  <button id="probe-share" type="button" class="btn btn-warning w-100 mb-3" hidden>Share</button>

  <h5>Results</h5>
  <pre id="probe-log" class="small bg-black p-2 rounded" style="white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 3em"></pre>
  <button id="probe-copy" type="button" class="btn btn-outline-light">Copy log</button>
  <button id="probe-clear" type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Clear log</button>
</div>
<script type="application/json" id="probe-data">{{ .Items }}</script>
<script src="./js/min/photos_probe.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
{{ end }}
